This rule ensures that a full session lock is triggered within no more than 900 seconds of inactivity."
      solution     : "Configure the macOS system to initiate the screen saver after 15 minutes of inactivity by installing the \"com.apple.screensaver\" configuration profile."
      reference    : "800-171|3.1.10,800-171r3|03.01.10a.,800-53|AC-11a.,800-53r5|AC-11a.,CAT|II,CCI|CCI-000057,CN-L3|8.1.4.1(b),GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),HIPAA|164.312(a)(2)(iii),ISO-27001-2022|A.7.7,ISO-27001-2022|A.8.1,ISO/IEC-27001|A.11.2.8,ITSG-33|AC-11a.,LEVEL|2M,NESA|T2.3.8,NESA|T2.3.9,NIAv2|AM23a,NIAv2|AM23b,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|8.1.8,PCI-DSSv4.0|8.2.8,Rule-ID|SV-259441r958402_rule,STIG-ID|APPL-14-000070,Vuln-ID|V-259441"
      see_also     : "https://workbench.cisecurity.org/benchmarks/24070"
