    <custom_item>
      type        : CMD_EXEC
      description : "1.6 APPL-14-000007"
      info        : "The macOS system must disable hot corners.

GROUP ID: V-259422RULE ID: SV-259422r958404

Hot corners must be disabled.

The information system conceals, via the session lock, information previously visible on the display with a publicly viewable image. Although hot corners can be used to initiate a session lock or to launch useful applications, they can also be configured to disable an automatic session lock from initiating. Such a configuration introduces the risk that a user might forget to manually lock the screen before stepping away from the computer."
      solution    : "Configure the macOS system to disable hot corners by installing the \"com.apple.ManagedClient.preferences\" configuration profile."
      reference   : "800-171|3.1.10,800-171r3|03.01.10,800-53|AC-11(1),800-53r5|AC-11(1),CAT|II,CCI|CCI-000060,CN-L3|8.1.4.1(b),GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),HIPAA|164.312(a)(2)(iii),ISO-27001-2022|A.7.7,ISO-27001-2022|A.8.1,ISO/IEC-27001|A.11.2.8,ITSG-33|AC-11(1),LEVEL|2M,NIAv2|AM23c,NIAv2|AM23d,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|8.1.8,PCI-DSSv4.0|8.2.8,Rule-ID|SV-259422r958404_rule,STIG-ID|APPL-14-000007,Vuln-ID|V-259422"
      see_also    : "https://workbench.cisecurity.org/benchmarks/24070"
      cmd         : "/usr/bin/profiles -P -o stdout | /usr/bin/grep -Ec '\"wvous-bl-corner\" = 0|\"wvous-br-corner\" = 0|\"wvous-tl-corner\" = 0|\"wvous-tr-corner\" = 0'"
      expect      : "^4$"
    </custom_item>

    <custom_item>
      type        : CMD_EXEC
      description : "1.60 APPL-14-002004"
      info        : "The macOS system must disable Location Services.

GROUP ID: V-259480RULE ID: SV-259480r958478

The information system must be configured to provide only essential capabilities. Disabling Location Services helps prevent the unauthorized connection of devices, unauthorized transfer of information, and unauthorized tunneling."
      solution    : "Configure the macOS system to disable Location Services with the following command:

/usr/bin/defaults write /var/db/locationd/Library/Preferences/ByHost/com.apple.locationd LocationServicesEnabled -bool false; /bin/launchctl kickstart -k system/com.apple.locationd

The system may need to be restarted for the update to take effect."
      reference   : "800-171|3.4.6,800-171|3.4.7,800-171r3|03.04.06,800-171r3|03.04.06a.,800-53|CM-7,800-53|CM-7a.,800-53r5|CM-7a.,CAT|II,CCI|CCI-000381,CN-L3|7.1.3.5(c),CN-L3|8.1.4.4(a),CSF|PR.IP-1,CSF|PR.PT-3,CSF2.0|PR.PS-01,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),ITSG-33|CM-7,ITSG-33|CM-7a.,LEVEL|2M,NIAv2|SS15a,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|2.2.1,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|2.2.2,PCI-DSSv4.0|2.2.3,QCSC-v1|3.2,Rule-ID|SV-259480r958478_rule,STIG-ID|APPL-14-002004,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.3,Vuln-ID|V-259480"
      see_also    : "https://workbench.cisecurity.org/benchmarks/24070"
      cmd         : "#!/bin/bash
{
/usr/bin/sudo -u _locationd /usr/bin/osascript -l JavaScript << EOS
$.NSUserDefaults.alloc.initWithSuiteName('com.apple.locationd')\
.objectForKey('LocationServicesEnabled').js
EOS
}"
      expect      : "false"
    </custom_item>

    <custom_item>
      type         : MACOSX_OSASCRIPT
      description  : "1.61 APPL-14-002005"
      info         : "The macOS system must disable Bonjour multicast.

GROUP ID: V-259481RULE ID: SV-259481r958478

Bonjour multicast advertising must be disabled to prevent the system from broadcasting its presence and available services over network interfaces."
      solution     : "Configure the macOS system to disable Bonjour multicast by installing the \"com.apple.mDNSResponder\" configuration profile."
      reference    : "800-171|3.4.6,800-171|3.4.7,800-171r3|03.04.06,800-171r3|03.04.06a.,800-53|CM-7,800-53|CM-7a.,800-53r5|CM-7a.,CAT|II,CCI|CCI-000381,CN-L3|7.1.3.5(c),CN-L3|8.1.4.4(a),CSF|PR.IP-1,CSF|PR.PT-3,CSF2.0|PR.PS-01,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),ITSG-33|CM-7,ITSG-33|CM-7a.,LEVEL|2M,NIAv2|SS15a,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|2.2.1,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|2.2.2,PCI-DSSv4.0|2.2.3,QCSC-v1|3.2,Rule-ID|SV-259481r958478_rule,STIG-ID|APPL-14-002005,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.3,Vuln-ID|V-259481"
      see_also     : "https://workbench.cisecurity.org/benchmarks/24070"
      expect       : "(?i)^(true|yes|[1-9][0-9]*)$"
      payload_key  : "NoMulticastAdvertisements"
